  "instructions": [
    "Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together lemon juice, olive oil, parsley, dill, garlic, salt, and pepper.",
    "Add the shrimp to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "Thread the shrimp onto the bamboo skewers, leaving a small space between each piece.",
    "Grill the skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally, until the shrimp are pink and cooked through.",
    "Serve immediately, garnished with additional parsley and lemon wedges if desired."
